e using off the shelf OBD devices to get diagnostics and real-time information of your car, smart bands for medical insights and your phone acting as a field gateway to communicate with the IoT Hub. The data we get from the phone and OBD device will be stored and analyzed using Azure services based on several inputs. This would enable meaningful insights on users driving behavior.   In case of emergency, nearby devices will be alerted immediately and a signal will be sent to our central server, which will send the location of the accident to the nearest emergency centers. This will also act as a base for smart traffic management system.","topics":[],"score":1728.0,"global_rank":300091},{"name":"natetan/pokesav-git","owner":"natetan","html_url":"https://github.com/natetan/pokesav-git","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A place to hold Pokesav HGSS + AR","topics":[],"score":1728.0,"global_rank":300092},{"name":"thedanschmidt/thedanschmidt.github.io","owner":"thedanschmidt","html_url":"https://github.com/thedanschmidt/thedanschmidt.github.io","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Personal information and projects page","topics":[],"score":1728.0,"global_rank":300093},{"name":"brandonlamb/RPG-Battle-System","owner":"brandonlamb","html_url":"https://github.com/brandonlamb/RPG-Battle-System","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A library for creating turn-based battles with action commands in libGDX.","topics":[],"score":1728.0,"global_rank":300094},{"name":"marchese29/ReachForTheStars","owner":"marchese29","html_url":"https://github.com/marchese29/ReachForTheStars","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Points at stars n' stuff","topics":[],"score":1728.0,"global_rank":300095},{"name":"RobStand/PatchbookSupport","owner":"RobStand","html_url":"https://github.com/RobStand/PatchbookSupport","stars":0,"forks":0,"wa